<title>USA: Capitol American Financial Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Capitol American Financial Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amount in thousands, except per share and share data)</p>
<p>			  Three Months Ended    Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			     September 30,	  September 30,</p>
<p>			  1996	  1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p>Total revenues</p>
<p>			 87,828	83,068     261,862     245,420</p>
<p> Net income	  11,714	11,203	38,785	34,163</p>
<p>Net income per weighted</p>
<p>average Common Share</p>
<p>			   0.67	  0.64	  2.22	  1.96</p>
