<p>		   17,489,190  17,454,290  17,483,556  17,473,886</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q3 includes legal and investment banking expenses of $950,000 related to the pending merger with Conseco Inc.</p>
<p>Q3 1995 includes a one-time charge of $1.8 million for litigation.</p>
<p>Full company name is Capitol American Financial Corp</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610</p>
